After the printf moves disk $n$ to C, move the $n-1$ disks from B to C using A: `move(n-1, B, A, C)`.
```c
void move(int n, char A, char B, char C)
{
    if (n > 0) {
        move(n-1, A, C, B);
        printf("Move disk %d from pole %c to pole %c\n", n, A, C);
        move(n-1, B, A, C);
    }
}
```
